discovery_text = "You collect the butler's records.
Routine inventories, servant schedules, and a marked series of absences suggest the household was failing long before the halls fell silent."
archive_text = "outine inventories and servant schedules from the Butler's Office. Several names are crossed out or marked absent in an increasingly irregular pattern."
